   "displayName": "Michelangelo: Stonemason Simulator - Steam Next Fest Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-06-07T17:33:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "🗿 Greetings, Sculptors! 🗿",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In preparation for Steam Next Fest on Monday, we’ve given our demo a fresh coat of paint!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎯 Here’s a quick overview of what’s new",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You now start straight at level 15 with a larger-radius golden chisel.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The first 15 skill points are invested in *Swift Hand* (chisel speed).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The 15-minute timer is gone; the demo now ends when you finish the first level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "XP gain has been doubled.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The UI has been reworked and includes a link to a feedback form.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🛠️ Plus a handful of smaller bug fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The red preview mode now turns off automatically once a sculpture is complete.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "The level panel in the upper-left now has a clean edge.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed rare horizontal black lines on the marble.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Easier to reach the lower part of the sculpture while kneeling.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rare cases of floating marble pieces have been resolved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Add the game to your wishlist and check out the updated demo!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Have fun! 💝",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Solid regards,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Three River Games (3RG)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
